        "source.end" "181"
        "rule.state" "text"
        "rule.text" "hybrid: mounting requires 5 Pet Master points, ≥1 Riding point, globally acquired Reins and a rideable tamed pet; further Riding points improve speed; no new species riding permission, Reins route or slot (§3.2 pet)"
