        "source.end" "183"
        "rule.state" "text"
        "rule.text" "hybrid: sailing requires 5 Swimming points, ≥1 Sailing point and a Boat bought from an item vendor and equipped in the single special slot; buying alone is insufficient; further Sailing points improve speed; boat and glider cannot be equipped together (§3.5)"
