        "source.file" "5_Constraints.md"
        "source.start" "206"
        "source.end" "206"
        "rule.state" "text"
        "rule.text" "hybrid: classify the attack, not merely its attacker, under §3.3 stat; exactly one equipment defence: magical uses Resistance, physical uses existing armor rules, never both; combo armor penetration does not extend to Resistance"
        "layer.state" "text"
        "layer.text" "runtime (deferred)"
    }
}

r_c_resistance_mitigation = element "c-resistance-mitigation" "Constraint" {
    tags "Constraint,Catalog"
    properties {
        "id" "c-resistance-mitigation"
        "kind" "Constraint"
        "order" "207"
        "source.commit" "175e0c59b6a05ead62d29bd851085cd5a3818378"
        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "5_Constraints.md"
        "source.start" "207"
        "source.end" "207"
        "rule.state" "text"
        "rule.text" "hybrid: for a magical hit with incoming damage `D ≥ 0` and Resistance `R ≥ 0`, the Resistance-stage result is `max(D - R, 0.1 × D)`; zero stays zero, fractions allowed, no minimum-one rounding; then existing block and damage-reduction multipliers, then absorption shields; not a final HP-loss floor, absorption may prevent all HP loss; preserve existing block eligibility/exhaustion, multiplier values, absorption-pool rules and status protections (§3.3 stat)"
        "layer.state" "text"
        "layer.text" "runtime (deferred)"
    }
}

r_c_resistance_dot = element "c-resistance-dot" "Constraint" {
    tags "Constraint,Catalog"
    properties {
        "id" "c-resistance-dot"
        "kind" "Constraint"
        "order" "208"
        "source.commit" "175e0c59b6a05ead62d29bd851085cd5a3818378"
        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "5_Constraints.md"
        "source.start" "208"
        "source.end" "208"
        "rule.state" "text"
        "rule.text" "hybrid: hit-derived DOT inherits its triggering hit's Resistance reduction once (§3.3 stat, item 4); never subtract Resistance again per tick; independently sourced poison and environmental hazards gain no Resistance protection; existing status identity/application/duration, dodge exceptions, drinks and status protections remain unchanged"
        "layer.state" "text"
        "layer.text" "runtime (deferred)"
    }
}

r_c_combat_burning_applications = element "c-combat-burning-applications" "Constraint" {
    tags "Constraint,Catalog"
    properties {
