        "rule.text" "hybrid combat hit-derived poison applications have independent lifetimes and schedules; a new application neither renews older stacks nor resets their next tick; dagger poison ticks at 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 s after its own application, preserving inherited hit damage/crit and the existing five-times-hit total over 5 s; preserve Resistance, dodge/status protections and aggro rules; environmental hazards and additional DOT buff timing are outside scope (§3.3 status-effect)"
        "layer.state" "text"
        "layer.text" "load-time (selected design inputs) + runtime"
    }
}

